<title>UK: Banco Safra prices $200 million Dec 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Safra prices $200 million Dec 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced by joint lead managers Bear Stearns and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO SAFRA (ACTING THROUGH CAYMAN BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     8.375     MATURITY   *20.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.75     PAY DATE   S29.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    99.75     SPREAD	+218 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 100-10  SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR/CI</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  30 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES     *PUT AND CALL OPTION 20.DEC.99 AT 99.5 AND 20.DEC.01</p>
<p>		AT 99.625</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
